Table full name: bigquery-public-data.san_francisco_transit_muni.fares
Column name: fare_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier a fare class.
Column name: rider_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier a rider category. Rider categories are used to assign different pricing to different groups of individuals
Column name: rider_desc Type: STRING Description: Text description of the rider category
Column name: price Type: NUMERIC Description: Contains the fare price, in USD
Column name: payment_method Type: STRING Description: Indicates when the fare must be paid. The following are valid values for this field: -  during: Indicates the fare is paid when riders board -  before: Indicates fare must be paid before riders board
Column name: transfers_permitted Type: STRING Description: Specifies the number of transfers permitted on this fare.  -  0: No transfers are permitted on this fare. -  1: One transfer is permitted on this fare. -  2: Two transfers are permitted on this fare. -  NULL: Unlimited transfers are permitted on this fare.
Column name: transfer_duration Type: INT64 Description: Specifies the length of time, in seconds, before a transfer expires. When used with a transfers_permitted value of 0, the transfer_duration field indicates how long a ticket is valid for a fare where no transfers are allowed.
Sample rows:
[{'fare_id': '5398', 'rider_id': '6', 'rider_desc': 'Disabled', 'price': '3.000000000', 'payment_method': '0', 'transfers_permitted': None, 'transfer_duration': 5400}, {'fare_id': '5398', 'rider_id': '5', 'rider_desc': 'Youth', 'price': '3.000000000', 'payment_method': '0', 'transfers_permitted': None, 'transfer_duration': 5400}, {'fare_id': '5398', 'rider_id': '3', 'rider_desc': 'Child', 'price': '3.000000000', 'payment_method': '0', 'transfers_permitted': None, 'transfer_duration': 5400}, {'fare_id': '5398', 'rider_id': '2', 'rider_desc': 'Senior', 'price': '3.000000000', 'payment_method': '0', 'transfers_permitted': None, 'transfer_duration': 5400}, {'fare_id': '5399', 'rider_id': '6', 'rider_desc': 'Disabled', 'price': '7.000000000', 'payment_method': '0', 'transfers_permitted': '0.0', 'transfer_duration': 0}]

